+/* ---- H2D read cursors ----
+ * wlan_en0.h posts with swdp_ring_post() on COPIES of e->rxpost / e->flow.ring, and that function refuses when (rd + depth - wr - 1) % depth == 0; nothing in wlan_en0.h ever moves
